(text "SHARED-RAIL STAGES (bom 17o; 115 V mains ruling 2026-10-28): T902 2x18 VAC series-aided 18-0-18 (S2+S3 = CT = GND, tied at T902 on ACENTRY) -> bridge + snubbers -> +-24 V raw (2x10 mF/50 V per rail) -> 6x parallel LT3045 = P16A +16.2 V, 6x parallel LT3094 = N16A -16.2 V (RULED 2026-11-03: class-A continuous ~0.5 A -> ~3.9 W spread 6 ways = ~0.65 W/die, ~39 C junction margin; shared SET node 600 uA x 27.0k, ~20 mR ballast per OUT, OUTS->common node, PGFB 475k/10k -> PG_ALL). T903 9 VAC -> bridge -> ~12 V raw -> U7901 TPS7A4501 = V8P3 8.35 V (59k/10k on 1.21 V). Shared rails feed BOTH PCIe mates." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 300.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "588c26e2-3969-4db8-a509-1bb6237a0ced"))
