(text "J7703/J7704 = pre-reg-board PCIe x4 mates (user-made riser PCBs plug these to main-board J603/J604). Pin map mirrors the main board: side B = shared rails P16A B1-B6, N16A B11-B16, V8P3 B21-B26 + GND; side A = branch rails 6 pins each + GND returns (LA/LB/LC on A1-A6/A11-A16/A21-A26, LC slot GND on J7704)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 560.000 40.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b2a8a296-a1f6-47f5-a39e-2103a99147e3"))
(text "J7705 = pre-reg-board PCIe x16 mate to Conn1/J506 (2026-11-16 ruling: all three links run through user-made riser PCBs with card-edge fingers - the Samtec SEAR interposers were not purchasable). Pin mirror of docs/PCIE_PIN_ASSIGNMENTS.md: side A = carrier power (V12SOM x20 SOURCED on this assembly - LRS-200-12 -> J931/J932 harness on the acentry section; V33_IF_IN source TBD here); side B = AP domain signals, SOM_PG, VAP_IO/GND_AP - pass-through for now (AP processor interconnect undecided)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 960.000 40.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8ab0a974-7f33-4a88-b74e-45eb53a528df"))
(text "TEST POINTS: reservoirs / AC secondaries / all eight regulator outputs on hook pads; GND below." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 560.000 160.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "26157402-5804-4ad4-9509-db8ae541919c"))
